# AIOS Intelligence Monitor
#
# The DeepSeek API key is NOT read from this file. It is stored in your
# operating system credential manager (Windows Credential Manager on Windows)
# and is configured through the web UI at http://127.0.0.1:8765/settings
#
# These variables are optional and only override filesystem locations.

# Where the database, reports, logs and cache are kept.
# AIOS_DATA_DIR=D:\AIOS\data
